{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "谢灵密谋彻底终结魅力远航  (Xie Ling Plots to Kill Charming Voyage)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back behind closed doors in his office, a seething Xie Ling vents to his deputy about Xingtian's defiant staff and decides where to strike back. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我真是够了，这公司到底养了一帮什么怪胎？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你说淳于乔他在这家公司是怎么待下去的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "谢总您先消消气，星天公司跟艾米卫视不同，风气一直很野。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在形势这么险恶，咱们新来乍到，得先跟同事搞好关系才行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "搞好关系？我看这帮人就是心里没忘了淳于乔！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "所以他们才变着法子给我穿小鞋，跟我斗是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我倒要看看，最后谁会笑到最后！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你知道要想打压这帮人的嚣张气焰，关键点是什么吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "是魅力远航！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "没错，就是因为这个节目一直阴魂不散。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "不过现在到头了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我要让这档节目彻底终结！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我真是够了，这公司到底养了一帮什么怪胎？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have truly had enough—what sort of misfits has this company been raising?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你说淳于乔他在这家公司是怎么待下去的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me how Chun Yuqiao ever managed to stay at a company like this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "谢总您先消消气，星天公司跟艾米卫视不同，风气一直很野。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Calm down first, Mr Xie; Xingtian is different from ME TV and has always had an untamed streak.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在形势这么险恶，咱们新来乍到，得先跟同事搞好关系才行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With the situation this tricky and us newly arrived, we ought to build goodwill with colleagues first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "搞好关系？我看这帮人就是心里没忘了淳于乔！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Build goodwill? I can tell this crowd simply has not forgotten Chun Yuqiao!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "所以他们才变着法子给我穿小鞋，跟我斗是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is why they keep tripping me up at every turn—so they want a fight, do they?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我倒要看看，最后谁会笑到最后！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I should like to see who gets the last laugh in the end!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你知道要想打压这帮人的嚣张气焰，关键点是什么吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you know the single key to crushing this crowd's arrogant momentum?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "是魅力远航！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is Charming Voyage!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "没错，就是因为这个节目一直阴魂不散。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Exactly—it is all because the ghost of that programme refuses to fade away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "不过现在到头了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, it has reached the end of the line now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我要让这档节目彻底终结！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going to put an end to this show once and for all!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我真是够了，这公司到底养了一帮什么怪胎？",
      "gap": 0.5
